{"Ad-hoc filters are applied multiple times because applyTemplateVariables is called in runSplitQuery and runShardSplitQuery, and then again inside DataSourceWithBackend.query() via super.query(). Since addAdHocFilters unconditionally appends each filter label without deduplication, filters get duplicated. For shard splitting, applyTemplateVariables is called 3 times total: in runShardSplitQuery, then runSplitQuery, then super.query(). The tests don't catch this because they mock datasource.runQuery, bypassing super.query() entirely.": 0.8851348757743835}